WEBVTT

00:00:18.544 --> 00:00:27.084
A ship laden with sorrows

00:00:29.054 --> 00:00:39.264
Loudly singing its song of ruin

00:00:44.074 --> 00:00:48.604
From the blackest depths

00:00:50.044 --> 00:00:55.144
It rises to the surface

00:00:59.124 --> 00:01:10.264
Oh! You and I! We stretch our white wings now!

00:01:11.064 --> 00:01:22.014
Flying off into the vast sky

00:01:22.014 --> 00:01:36.184
We dream of that day, dream of that day

00:02:22.004 --> 00:02:26.704
What on earth is she dreaming about?

00:02:28.674 --> 00:02:31.514
False Charm.

00:02:39.284 --> 00:02:41.194
Good morning, Miss Kozuki.

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:44.384
Good morning, Miss Senkoji!

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:49.124
Helping Gen again in the garden?
That's hard work!

00:02:49.434 --> 00:02:52.334
Oh, no. I enjoy it!

00:02:52.464 --> 00:02:54.264
Oh? That's good.

00:02:54.704 --> 00:02:58.194
Er... Where's Mari?

00:02:58.344 --> 00:02:59.634
Good question.

00:03:04.444 --> 00:03:06.274
Is something wrong?

00:03:06.684 --> 00:03:10.384
No, nothing! See you in class!

00:03:11.254 --> 00:03:12.654
See you.

00:03:19.594 --> 00:03:21.084
'Morning.

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:23.194
Good morning!

00:03:26.264 --> 00:03:28.564
How was sharing a room?

00:03:31.174 --> 00:03:34.614
It was a long, long night.

00:03:37.544 --> 00:03:39.604
You look tired...

00:03:40.454 --> 00:03:46.544
I didn't get a wink of sleep...
thanks to you-know-who's sleep-talking!

00:03:47.354 --> 00:03:49.054
Sleep-talking?

00:03:49.424 --> 00:03:55.954
Really? You seemed fast asleep on
the floor. You were even drooling!

00:03:56.064 --> 00:03:57.204
Drooling?

00:03:57.204 --> 00:03:58.434
Listen here!

00:03:58.434 --> 00:04:04.374
I don't know what kind of dream you were
having, but you kept whimpering and calling out!

00:04:04.374 --> 00:04:07.304
You kept me up all night!

00:04:10.074 --> 00:04:11.974
Wh-what?

00:04:25.864 --> 00:04:27.594
What?

00:04:28.734 --> 00:04:30.134
Rice.

00:04:30.834 --> 00:04:31.964
A grain of rice.

00:04:31.964 --> 00:04:33.164
Huh?

00:04:33.164 --> 00:04:35.294
Stuck to your cheek.

00:04:36.604 --> 00:04:38.434
I knew that!

00:04:54.594 --> 00:04:58.184
Decelerating both thrusters.
Current velocity: 45 AN.

00:04:58.494 --> 00:05:01.224
Third patrol squadron,
assume surround formation.

00:05:02.034 --> 00:05:04.694
Has there been a response from Ship Five?

00:05:05.134 --> 00:05:09.364
No response. Only silence.

00:05:09.774 --> 00:05:13.204
Master Commander, how should we proceed?

00:05:14.444 --> 00:05:16.274
Maintain our course.

00:05:17.044 --> 00:05:20.344
If they don't answer, we'll have to
board them and investigate.

00:05:21.484 --> 00:05:24.284
What happened to Ship Five?

00:05:30.724 --> 00:05:36.194
Very soon, we'll know the crew's status.
Take heart, Azanael.

00:05:36.194 --> 00:05:37.494
Aye-aye!

00:06:00.854 --> 00:06:01.754
It's the Headmaster!

00:06:01.754 --> 00:06:03.484
He's so cool!

00:06:07.864 --> 00:06:11.264
Thank you! Thanks to you, I'm on time!

00:06:11.264 --> 00:06:14.204
Of course. We have to help
each other when we can.

00:06:15.434 --> 00:06:16.674
No way!

00:06:16.674 --> 00:06:19.004
Did she stay over with him?!

00:06:19.004 --> 00:06:20.274
Oh, wow!

00:06:20.274 --> 00:06:22.814
Miss Sugawara! Naughty, naughty!

00:06:22.814 --> 00:06:24.744
My beloved Headmaster!

00:06:24.744 --> 00:06:27.114
Don't be ridiculous, girls!

00:06:27.114 --> 00:06:29.204
Run along to your classrooms!

00:06:29.654 --> 00:06:31.984
It's not like that! For crying out loud!

00:06:31.984 --> 00:06:33.184
Hello!

00:06:43.564 --> 00:06:46.694
Something happened, didn't it?

00:06:47.104 --> 00:06:49.194
Well, yes.

00:06:53.644 --> 00:06:55.734
Miss Senkoji...

00:07:08.354 --> 00:07:13.224
Their course hasn't changed.
It looks like they intend to make contact.

00:07:13.424 --> 00:07:15.694
I see. Novaal's coming...

00:07:16.034 --> 00:07:17.764
Very well, then.

00:07:19.064 --> 00:07:20.664
We'll mobilize Blue.

00:07:20.904 --> 00:07:26.434
Reply to Novaal: "Our vessel is mobile.
Specify point of contact."

00:07:26.944 --> 00:07:28.344
Commander!

00:07:28.514 --> 00:07:29.914
Roger!

00:07:42.554 --> 00:07:44.324
Er, Mari?

00:07:44.464 --> 00:07:47.194
It's almost time for class...

00:07:48.834 --> 00:07:50.894
She can see me again?

00:07:51.364 --> 00:07:52.924
So it seems.

00:07:53.104 --> 00:07:56.434
Even though I'm shifting? But why?

00:07:56.674 --> 00:07:59.164
Never mind. Prepare the ship for departure.

00:07:59.474 --> 00:08:00.564
Yes, Ma'am.

00:08:03.014 --> 00:08:04.704
Good question.

00:08:05.044 --> 00:08:06.774
Why, indeed?

00:08:09.254 --> 00:08:12.774
Those two don't seem to be getting along.

00:08:13.624 --> 00:08:16.324
But when I see them together,

00:08:16.324 --> 00:08:20.054
I can't help thinking they could
really be good friends.

00:08:20.934 --> 00:08:22.734
I wonder if they've made up?

00:08:22.734 --> 00:08:24.494
Well, that's good.

00:08:25.104 --> 00:08:27.094
For Mari, you mean?

00:08:29.834 --> 00:08:31.004
Go on.

00:08:31.004 --> 00:08:33.164
Right. See you later!

00:08:39.114 --> 00:08:40.844
No. Good for you!

00:08:45.224 --> 00:08:46.054
Like I said...

00:08:46.054 --> 00:08:46.724
Director's Office
Like I said...

00:08:46.724 --> 00:08:48.654
Director's Office
The train was late, and I was going
to be late for school!

00:08:48.654 --> 00:08:49.824
Director's Office
Silence!

00:08:49.824 --> 00:08:50.054
Silence!

00:08:50.054 --> 00:08:56.124
Even if you were tardy, your behavior caused
confusion among the students!

00:08:56.264 --> 00:08:57.804
Honestly!

00:08:57.804 --> 00:09:00.294
Listen well, Miss Sugawara!

00:09:00.434 --> 00:09:02.664
At the Kaio Academy...

00:09:04.574 --> 00:09:06.334
Circuit connected.

00:09:06.774 --> 00:09:10.504
Hello? Is this the Kaio Academy?

00:09:10.944 --> 00:09:14.514
How do you do?
This is Hagino Senkoji's mother speaking.

00:09:14.514 --> 00:09:19.354
She's in the 11th Grade Cherry Blossoms Class.

00:09:19.754 --> 00:09:26.754
Why, Mrs. Senkoji! I do so appreciate your
exceptional appreciation of our school values...

00:09:29.234 --> 00:09:31.024
A loss in the family?

00:09:31.234 --> 00:09:35.334
My deepest condolences. Yes, of course.

00:09:37.244 --> 00:09:41.734
Please convey my kindest regards
to your parents, Miss Senkoji.

00:09:41.844 --> 00:09:43.934
Thank you, Ma'am.

00:09:49.284 --> 00:09:50.084
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms

00:09:50.084 --> 00:09:51.284
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
All right, class!

00:09:51.284 --> 00:09:51.824
Home Room
School Festival Plans

00:09:51.824 --> 00:09:55.784
Home Room
School Festival Plans
It's time to seriously think about our
project for the school festival!

00:09:56.424 --> 00:09:59.794
Miss Sugawara? When's the wedding?

00:09:59.794 --> 00:10:04.394
Are you really replacing
Miss Maiyama as Director?

00:10:05.404 --> 00:10:07.494
Listen well, class!

00:10:08.134 --> 00:10:10.474
Many prominent members of the
local community will visit

00:10:10.474 --> 00:10:15.134
our prestigious Kaio Academy
during the school festival.

00:10:15.914 --> 00:10:18.544
This is a crucial event,

00:10:18.544 --> 00:10:24.354
at which your contribution will be inscribed
in the annals of our school history!

00:10:25.584 --> 00:10:29.284
That's what Director Maiyama said, anyway!

00:10:30.824 --> 00:10:34.194
Got that? Give it some serious thought!

00:10:34.364 --> 00:10:34.694
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms

00:10:34.694 --> 00:10:38.264
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
All right, that wraps up home room for today...

00:10:38.264 --> 00:10:39.164
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms

00:10:45.174 --> 00:10:46.604
I'll get out here.

00:10:46.604 --> 00:10:47.634
Huh?

00:10:50.274 --> 00:10:52.714
Are you sure? We're quite far from the station...

00:10:52.714 --> 00:10:54.544
This is fine. Thank you.

00:11:14.804 --> 00:11:17.364
Commander entering bridge.

00:11:22.844 --> 00:11:24.334
Commander!

00:11:53.944 --> 00:11:56.434
It's been 20 skoors...

00:12:08.994 --> 00:12:10.354
Releasing anchor.

00:12:10.354 --> 00:12:12.854
Set course for target destination
and fire up both thrusters.

00:12:16.134 --> 00:12:18.104
Firing up both thrusters!

00:12:18.764 --> 00:12:26.074
Emil Force Drive: Rotation increasing.
Pressure rising in Chambers Two and Three.

00:12:29.874 --> 00:12:33.614
Ship Five Blue, take off.

00:12:34.314 --> 00:12:36.014
Blue, taking off.

00:13:22.164 --> 00:13:27.404
So, if the pressure on a gas is doubled at a
given temperature, its volume is halved.

00:13:27.404 --> 00:13:32.944
If the pressure is tripled,
its volume shrinks to one third.

00:13:32.944 --> 00:13:36.344
The pressure on a gas and its volume
are inversely proportional.

00:14:07.714 --> 00:14:11.644
Scout Fleet Ships Two and Three,
transport complete.

00:14:12.044 --> 00:14:16.784
Ship Four has arrived. Transport complete.

00:14:17.314 --> 00:14:21.984
Novaal to Ship Five.
Ice density at destination is dissipating.

00:14:22.324 --> 00:14:24.084
Proceed to destination.

00:14:26.564 --> 00:14:30.724
Ship Five to Novaal. Proceeding to destination.

00:14:31.004 --> 00:14:32.694
This is Novaal. Roger.

00:14:33.664 --> 00:14:34.434
It's you!

00:14:34.434 --> 00:14:38.064
Azanaaael... Tee-hee!

00:14:39.804 --> 00:14:41.344
Surprised?

00:14:41.344 --> 00:14:43.674
Silly! Focus on the mission!

00:14:47.384 --> 00:14:49.814
You're beautiful when you're stern, too!

00:14:53.524 --> 00:14:54.814
Bye, now!

00:15:06.434 --> 00:15:10.034
Destination reached. Vessel is stationary.

00:15:11.804 --> 00:15:14.274
Ship Five ready for transport.

00:15:17.074 --> 00:15:19.244
Go ahead, Ekaril.

00:15:20.914 --> 00:15:22.944
Blue, initiate transport.

00:15:23.654 --> 00:15:25.244
Initiating transport.

00:15:43.974 --> 00:15:45.804
Ship Five, transport complete.

00:15:46.074 --> 00:15:48.574
Confirmed. Ship Five transport complete.

00:15:48.574 --> 00:15:49.714
When ice density decreases,
proceed to target destination.

00:15:49.714 --> 00:15:51.804
See you, Onomil.
When ice density decreases,
proceed to target destination.

00:15:52.044 --> 00:15:54.314
Roger. Decelerating both thrusters.

00:16:01.394 --> 00:16:05.894
Oh, stop it!

00:16:05.894 --> 00:16:07.554
Here, get closer!

00:16:10.194 --> 00:16:11.894
I'm recording!

00:16:14.804 --> 00:16:16.274
Like this?

00:16:16.274 --> 00:16:17.604
Yes!

00:16:58.284 --> 00:17:01.544
Mari, you seemed kind of blue today.

00:17:01.684 --> 00:17:04.344
Oh? I'm the same as always...

00:17:05.184 --> 00:17:06.984
All right, it's in your hands!

00:17:07.624 --> 00:17:09.024
Leave it to us!

00:17:11.324 --> 00:17:12.724
Now, let's see...

00:17:13.924 --> 00:17:15.694
Are you just getting back?

00:17:16.634 --> 00:17:18.234
Hurry up and get ready!

00:17:18.234 --> 00:17:19.594
Oh, right!

00:17:19.764 --> 00:17:20.834
What?

00:17:20.834 --> 00:17:23.734
We have cooking practicum tonight.

00:17:24.034 --> 00:17:26.134
Hadn't you heard?

00:17:26.404 --> 00:17:29.844
Once a month, the whole dorm
cooks dinner together.

00:17:31.114 --> 00:17:32.584
Me, too?

00:17:32.784 --> 00:17:34.904
Bring three more tablecloths!

00:17:34.984 --> 00:17:37.414
And two more sets of dishes!

00:17:37.414 --> 00:17:39.224
Thanks! That one too, okay?

00:17:39.224 --> 00:17:40.524
Are the tables set?

00:17:40.524 --> 00:17:43.794
When you're done with that,
would you help me put these out?

00:17:43.794 --> 00:17:44.464
Mari!
When you're done with that,
would you help me put these out?

00:17:44.464 --> 00:17:44.754
Mari!

00:17:45.564 --> 00:17:48.354
Here, could you help with this?

00:17:48.564 --> 00:17:50.394
Um, okay.

00:18:32.174 --> 00:18:34.244
After a prolonged lapse in communication,

00:18:34.244 --> 00:18:42.614
we will meet with Ship Five to directly
confirm the details of the accident.

00:18:44.084 --> 00:18:48.644
All other ships: Continue investigating
your assigned areas.

00:18:49.324 --> 00:18:50.654
Over.

00:18:52.394 --> 00:18:54.724
The accident...

00:18:56.894 --> 00:19:02.634
Thanks to everyone's sterling efforts,
tonight's dinner looks delicious!

00:19:03.434 --> 00:19:09.274
All right, troops! Time to enjoy
the fruits of our labors!

00:19:10.344 --> 00:19:11.644
Let's eat!

00:19:11.784 --> 00:19:13.404
Let's eat!

00:19:23.454 --> 00:19:25.454
Who made this?

00:19:37.104 --> 00:19:39.044
Okay, good night!

00:19:39.174 --> 00:19:40.544
Good night!

00:19:40.544 --> 00:19:42.204
Okay! Thanks, girls!

00:19:44.044 --> 00:19:46.244
Man, that pasta!

00:19:46.444 --> 00:19:48.914
Too bad Hagino wasn't here to taste it!

00:19:49.214 --> 00:19:52.944
Hagino's too sharp.
She wouldn't have touched it.

00:19:53.424 --> 00:19:55.014
I'm sorry.

00:19:55.354 --> 00:19:57.724
Don't worry about it.

00:19:57.724 --> 00:20:00.194
We're all done here. You can go to bed.

00:20:01.064 --> 00:20:02.724
Good night.

00:20:09.904 --> 00:20:11.034
Um...

00:20:11.874 --> 00:20:16.204
Mari told me she'd never cooked before.

00:20:16.514 --> 00:20:19.914
I should have been more attentive...

00:20:21.754 --> 00:20:23.184
Don't worry about it.

00:20:23.454 --> 00:20:25.074
But Mari seemed so...

00:20:25.424 --> 00:20:30.384
I don't think it's the food that's bothering her.

00:20:30.694 --> 00:20:32.094
Huh?

00:20:45.674 --> 00:20:47.144
Are you okay?

00:20:47.344 --> 00:20:49.344
Maybe you should lie down...

00:20:49.344 --> 00:20:50.704
Don't touch me!

00:20:51.844 --> 00:20:54.574
What's with you, anyway?

00:20:55.154 --> 00:21:01.024
Trying to throttle me, getting us put in the
same room... what're you trying to do?

00:21:01.324 --> 00:21:03.344
What do you want from me?

00:21:04.524 --> 00:21:07.224
I don't want anything from you!

00:21:08.664 --> 00:21:11.184
Is that so?

00:21:11.464 --> 00:21:13.994
Well, I've got a few ideas of my own!

00:21:19.574 --> 00:21:20.874
Aren't you going to sleep?

00:21:20.874 --> 00:21:23.474
You go to sleep first!

00:22:25.144 --> 00:22:26.364
Never...

00:22:26.704 --> 00:22:27.974
again...

00:22:28.674 --> 00:22:30.664
Destination reached.

00:22:31.214 --> 00:22:34.014
Novaal detected. They're already at the surface.

00:22:37.184 --> 00:22:39.514
Surface and make contact.

00:22:40.084 --> 00:22:41.554
Surfacing.

00:22:54.874 --> 00:22:56.804
Ship Five surfacing.

00:23:29.474 --> 00:23:36.934
Standing side by side, hand in hand, by the sky

00:23:37.744 --> 00:23:47.784
Pledging our futures to the horizon

00:23:47.784 --> 00:23:55.454
A gentle breeze blowing

00:23:56.164 --> 00:24:04.034
As we melted into tomorrow

00:24:04.634 --> 00:24:08.244
The passing time

00:24:08.244 --> 00:24:13.574
Quietly watches over you

00:24:13.784 --> 00:24:17.514
Our sadness, our good-byes

00:24:17.514 --> 00:24:23.014
And our blue tears all make us stronger

00:24:24.354 --> 00:24:28.664
We sour after our dreams like budding flowers

00:24:28.664 --> 00:24:33.504
Searching for answers in life

00:24:33.504 --> 00:24:37.804
Always believing in the day

00:24:37.804 --> 00:24:43.514
We'll proudly unfurl our petals

00:24:43.514 --> 00:24:47.474
In the blue dreams!

00:25:02.094 --> 00:25:10.334
The sadness of losing a loved one turns into
flames of hatred, burning in Azanael's heart.

00:25:12.344 --> 00:25:15.374
Hagino resolves herself to incurring that wrath,

00:25:15.374 --> 00:25:20.114
but separates from her fleet
to save Mari Wakatake.

00:25:22.684 --> 00:25:27.814
Next on Blue Drop: Dahlia Pinnata.
